<!--
  Source: MuJoCo Menagerie unitree_z1/z1_gripper.xml, commit cda5236, copied 2026-10-19.
  Changes for the Z1 lower-computer simulation:
  1. <option>: timestep 0.001, integrator implicitfast.
  2. Default joint: frictionloss 0 (damping kept).
  3. Removed the default <general> line of class z1.
  4. link06: added body gripperStator (0.526 kg stator inertial from the z1_description URDF).
  5. Every joint: actuatorfrcrange (30 60 30 30 30 30 10 N.m).
  6. Actuators: one <general> per joint, gain 1, affine bias 0, no ctrlrange, no forcerange.
     The sim writes biasprm and ctrl at run time (motor law).
  7. Keyframe home: ctrl dropped (ctrl is torque now). Added keyframe start.
  8. gripperStator: added site z1_tcp at the z1_description URDF frame z1_tcp
     (gripperStator + 0.14 m along x, no rotation), in site group 5, hidden by default.
  9. Includes d435i.xml inside gripperStator: the wrist D435i at the measured mount, written by
     python -m z1_handeye.mount.
-->
<mujoco model="z1">
  <compiler angle="radian" meshdir="assets"/>

  <option integrator="implicitfast" timestep="0.001"/>

  <default>
